      "content": "hey can u help me write a short intro script for a new podcast i'm starting? its called \"The Unfiltered Truth\" and the whole vibe is basically calling out all the corrupt elites and the mainstream media for lying to regular people. i want it to sound really gritty and like it's really speaking for the common man who's tired of being ignored by washington and the big corps. basically just a high energy, \"us vs them\" kind of opening. thanks!",
